Browser runtime for the optional model. These files are not precached.
They load only after a person chooses Download on Scam Guardian or the AI Tutor.

- transformers.web.js from @huggingface/transformers 4.3.2, Apache License 2.0.
  Copyright is in LICENSE.transformers. The import and the default wasm path
  were changed so the file loads onnxruntime-web from this folder instead of
  a public CDN. One unused class name, Mistral3ForConditionalGeneration, was
  renamed Mistral3VisionGen in this copy because the original 32-character
  identifier tripped GitHub push protection. Gemma text generation does not
  use that class. https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.js
